# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Svella, Ice Shaper's second ability looks at the top four cards and may cast a spell from among them without paying its mana cost.
# Forcing: eight untapped lands pay {6}{R}{G}; the top four hold two castable spells, so the controller chooses between them or declines.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Svella, Ice Shaper — the activated ability under test.
#   Llanowar Elves, Grizzly Bears — the two spells offered from the top four.
#   Forest, Forest — the non-spell cards of the top four, which go to the bottom.
#   Island, Island — filler below the top four.
# Protocol path: activation, resolution, card choice among library cards, free cast, rest to the bottom.

